{"id": "UgwPr31zBVfwPT0KkOl4AaABAg.AYo9LgM_6hjAYyKJe7IjMR", "parent": "UgwPr31zBVfwPT0KkOl4AaABAg", "likes": 1, "text": "@세계눈_WorldEye kovač는 코바시치가 아니고 코바치", "published": "2026-07-07T15:45:42", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
